## New for this step: `Agent` persists every final reply into context

`@context.add_message(:assistant, text)` added to all three exit paths —
`run`'s success path, `wrap_up`'s success path, and its `ApiError`
fallback path. Without this, a REPL's follow-up turns couldn't see what
the agent said before (Context is shared across turns; only the model's
own response text was previously discarded, unlike tool_use/tool_result
messages which were already persisted since `05_agent_loop`).

